flowchart LR
    T([Webhook: RCA Concluded]) --> A[Task agent: Verdict Explainer]
    A --> S{Switch: NEP verdict}
    S -- HOLD or APPLY --> P[/Approval: heal PTP + unlock cell/]
    S -- NO_ACTION --> E1([end])
    P -- approved --> H[AAP JT: RAN - Heal PTP Timing]
    P -- rejected --> R[AAP JT: Record rejection / open incident] --> E2([end])
    H --> W[Wait 10 s] --> V[REST: verification RCA]
    V --> C{Verdict NO_ACTION?}
    C -- yes --> CL[AAP JT: Close RCA]
    C -- no --> ES[AAP JT: Escalate]
